<title>RUSSIA: TENNIS-SWEDEN'S JOHANSSON WINS ST PETERSBURG OPEN TITLE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN'S JOHANSSON WINS ST PETERSBURG OPEN TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the</p>
<p>final at the $300,000 St Petersburg Open men's tennis tournament</p>
<p>on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Thomas Johansson (Sweden) beat 7-Renzo Furlan (Italy) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
